# Data Directory

This directory stores downloaded Kaggle datasets.

Datasets are automatically downloaded by the `data_loader.py` module.

## Structure After Download:
```
data/
├── us_supply_chain/
├── operations_risk/
├── time_series/
├── weather_data/
├── amazon_delivery/
├── furniture_orders/
├── engineered_features.csv
└── target_variables.csv
```
